cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FlipDoctor, please cite it as below."
title: "FlipDoctor — one-tap health & self-diagnostics for the Flipper Zero"
abstract: >-
  A one-tap self-diagnostics application for the Flipper Zero that tests each
  hardware subsystem (sub-GHz radio, NFC/RFID coil, IR transmit/receive, GPIO,
  SD card, battery, buttons/display) and produces an interpretable
  pass/fail/warn/inconclusive health report with confidence levels, plain-
  language guidance, a used-buyer verification mode, and baseline comparison.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Krishita17/flipdoctor-flipperzero"
authors:
